flowchart TD
    A([runFraudAnalysisStage\ncalled]) --> B[Engine 1: analyseDamageConsistency\nphysics-damage coherence\nzone vs impact direction\nconsistency score 0-100]

    A --> C[Engine 2: analyseQuoteDeviation\nquote vs AI estimate\ndeviation percentage\noverpricing indicators]

    A --> D[Engine 3: analyseDocumentation\ndocument completeness\ninconsistency flags\nfrom Stage 3 inputRecovery]

    A --> E[Engine 4: evaluateScenarioFraud\nbuildScenarioFraudInput\nscenario-aware 3-tier engine\nR-D-02: 3-tier risk_level]

    B --> F[merge allIndicators\ndedup scenario flags\napply trust reduction\nfrom scenario engine]
    C --> F
    D --> F
    E --> F

    F --> G[computeWeightedFraudScore\nweighted sum of\nall FraudIndicators\nby category weight]

    G --> H[scoreToLevel\nFSS-2026-001 bands:\nminimal, low, moderate\nhigh, critical]

    H --> I[photoForensics\nrunPhotoForensics\nphase 1 and 2 analysis\nmanipulation indicators]

    I --> J([return Stage8Output\nfraudRiskLevel, score\nindicators, scenarioResult\nphotoForensicsResult])

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style J fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style E fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
